{"summary":"Connect words by meaning in a relaxing brain puzzle you can play offline.","description":"Word Bridges is a relaxing word puzzle game where you connect words by meaning and build clever associations.\n\nIf you enjoy word connect games, brain puzzles and association games, Word Bridges offers a fresh and thoughtful experience. Each level challenges you to find hidden connections between words and link them into logical groups.\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n• Connect words by association\n• Find meaningful word connections\n• Build bridges between related words\n• Solve increasingly challenging word puzzles\n\nWHY YOU’LL LOVE WORD BRIDGES\n• Relaxing word game for adults\n• Smart brain training without pressure\n• Offline word puzzle – play without internet\n• Clean and minimal design\n• Perfect for short breaks or long sessions\n\nWord Bridges combines classic word connect mechanics with association-based gameplay. It’s a casual word game that helps you relax, focus and train your brain at the same time.\n\nWhether you’re looking for a calming word puzzle, a brain game to sharpen your mind, or an offline word game to enjoy anywhere, Word Bridges is the perfect choice.\n\nStart connecting words, building associations and enjoying a relaxing word puzzle experience today.","esrbNotes":"Violent References, Mild Language","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $17.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XFfYry3X9Og?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mn0ciJ1meWAA5kiths-Rb59Jabf3cELRNLRvhPdgJ0832klqgCUOGyJflOdPM63uLVmqxh5-80UiwIEddX0-3g","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zokLL5K_lTjmI19HiV0zWC39NtZbS8b3aXqBe77GljCIoB4FWXO4y4Wu3cvOA1zHhvrBrODtYKJYwTtCZvryDsU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VSu8cHU0Ty5f74CIQ6BotcfARI9MgCz6cLajuGOQGt6rOdD624P5IRMAe71aE99Gt6d7Nc5upHfpsHE2b6mj01Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zy4-5spblGR9USfqSJlhD_9zCn6ycTeisT5Wfy6VrErOW54IOgwbzjwqc3MPEsydQvsGZIIFpY